WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Let's do this.

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.937
-You're getting woke.

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:07.206
♪♪

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:09.642
-Hey, I'm here with
the one and only Nicki Minaj,

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.111
and we are going on
a dinner date to Red Lobster.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:13.913
-Yeah.
-I'm very excited for this.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.082
I've never, ever been
to Red Lobster ever.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.451
I don't know why.
Our paths never crossed.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.319
You've been there.
You actually --

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:21.787
You worked there at one point?

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:24.290
-I have worked at a couple
different Red Lobsters,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.893
and I've gotten fired from
all three or four of them.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:27.794
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.428
-Well, I'm sorry
to bring that up,

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:30.830
but we're gonna have fun
tonight!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:31.631
-Yay!

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.098
♪♪

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:34.133
Oh, hello!

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.068
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:37.770
Oh, this is really good.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.872
-All right, one of these.

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:42.341
♪♪

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:44.677
First things first,
we need a drink, right?

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.446
-Yes.
-What was your drink --

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.147
Well, you didn't drink
while you were on the job,

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.283
but what was your favorite drink
that you served?

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.518
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.354
-I always liked this thing
called Red Passion Colada.

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:57.490
But they don't have
red Alizé anymore.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.925
Therefore, I cannot get it.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.027
The other good thing
is a Lobsterita.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:03.062
-Lobsteritas?

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.363
♪♪

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:07.433
-Here we go, guys.
Lobsteritas, frozen strawberry.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.702
You got it, Nicki?
-Thank you. Yes.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.670
-Awesome.
-Thank you so much!

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.539
-Are you joking me?
-I am not joking.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.207
-No, you're absolutely
joking me.

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:17.443
-There you are, Jimmy.
-Oh, my God. Thank you.

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:18.711
-Enjoy.
-It is so good.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.880
You paying?
-I'm definitely getting an Uber.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.548
I know that.
-But are you paying?

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.317
-Yeah, of course.
-Okay. Thank you.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.352
-Please, this is --
-I ain't got no money

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.688
to spending all this money
at no Red Lobster, child.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:29.522
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.791
♪♪

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.459
Let's act like
we're on a blind date.

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:34.326
-This is great.

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:35.661
-How do you like
your Lobsterita?

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:37.396
-I'm really having a good time
tonight.

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:38.965
-Thanks.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:42.235
-I like the Lobsterita,
but I like the view even more.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.203
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:45.371
-Of me?
-No, yeah.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.507
We're pretending
we're on a blind date.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:48.608
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.476
-I haven't dated in a long time.
[ Laughs ]

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.345
Can I have more of that?

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.280
♪♪

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.414
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:57.349
-I have some biscuits for you.

00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:58.851
Enjoy. Those are
our Cheddar Bay Biscuits.

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:00.119
They're delicious.

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:02.154
-Let me talk about this,
because I worked at Red Lobster,

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:04.390
and I know everything
about every food here.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:09.094
So this is handmade

00:02:09.094 --> 00:02:11.531
by a bunch of African people
in the back.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.566
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.469
This is a Cheddar Bay Biscuit
toast.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:20.272
You got to go like this,
1, 2, 3, pssh!

00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:26.111
[ Indistinct conversations,
silverware clinking ]

00:02:26.111 --> 00:02:28.348
-This is absolutely fantastic.
-Told you!

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:29.949
-Then you can go like this, too.

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:32.985
1, 2, 3, and then in your mouth.

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:34.219
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.219 --> 00:02:35.788
-Mmm.
-That's a good biscuit.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.558
-Okay. But my pet peeve is when
people ask for extra biscuits.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:40.326
Please do not ask
for more biscuits,

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.427
'cause I will slap you.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.695
-Can we have more biscuits?

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.363
'Cause that is what
I really want.

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:46.865
♪♪

00:02:46.865 --> 00:02:49.601
I love it.
D-Lob. That's what I call it.

00:02:49.601 --> 00:02:50.903
-D-Lob?
-Yeah.

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.973
If you're been here enough,
you call it D-Lob,

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.709
and then, dude --
And then S-Fish, live.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:59.111
They want you to live.
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:01.747
-So I love it. I get it.
Look at this.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:03.716
Are you kidding me?
Hey, wait a sec.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:05.217
A-hole fish?

00:03:05.217 --> 00:03:06.352
Oh, a whole fish.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.254
-How are we doing?
Are we ready to order?

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.623
-Two ultimate feasts,
and there's other things.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.991
-And I want to add Cajun chicken
pasta to mine.

00:03:12.991 --> 00:03:13.993
-Okay. Awesome.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.595
-She's gonna add just some
stuff.

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:18.330
♪♪

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.000
-Oh, my God.
This is a lot of food.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.903
-What do we do first?
-I like fried shrimp,

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:26.639
so we can do the toast and dump
it in your tartar sauce

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:27.973
like we did the other thing.

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:31.243
So you go, 1, 2, 3, dip.

00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:32.845
-Uh-huh.

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.881
-What the hell are you doing?!

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:35.782
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:39.752
-Ooh. [ Coughs ]

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:41.854
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:45.124
You saved my life.
You saved my life today.

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:47.893
♪♪

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:50.596
-Now, I'm gonna show you
how to crack this, okay?

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:53.365
-Yep.
-You just go like this.

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:54.933
Well, let's start with
the legs, maybe.

00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:58.537
And you go like this.
And you squeeze...

00:03:58.537 --> 00:04:01.507
Oh, God. Um...

00:04:01.507 --> 00:04:02.575
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:04.577
-Wow.
I can't believe you got fired.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:06.412
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.313
-But see, that's why
I like the ultimate feast,

00:04:08.313 --> 00:04:09.882
'cause it's already done
for you.

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:12.452
-Oh, that's right.
You go ultimate feast...

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.987
-Yeah.
-...then you can just...

00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:17.289
Ah, and splitskis?
-Yes. Sure.

00:04:17.289 --> 00:04:21.494
-Come on. Cheers.

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:24.430
-Mmm. So good.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.533
-I mean...
-So good.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:30.403
Aren't you happy you came here
for the first time in your life?

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.338
-Can we have more biscuits?

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:33.906
Ah, man.

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:36.308
♪♪

00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:39.244
So, tell me why you got fired
from Red Lobster.

00:04:39.244 --> 00:04:42.181
-I walked up to this lady.

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:44.350
Her and her boyfriend
had walked out of the restaurant

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.119
and they took my pen
and they didn't tip me.

00:04:47.119 --> 00:04:49.288
I walked to the car,
I banged on the car window,

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:51.890
and I said, "Give me my pen!"

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.994
-So far, it sounds like
that's not a big deal.

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:57.596
-I started going like this...

00:04:57.596 --> 00:04:59.065
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, you're number one.

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:00.900
-You're number one.
You're number one, as well.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.235
-And my manager fired me
on the spot.

00:05:03.235 --> 00:05:04.470
-Tell the manager, "Hey,

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.106
I was trying to get
restaurant property back

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:08.908
'cause they stole your pen."

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:11.543
♪♪

00:05:11.543 --> 00:05:13.079
Oh, you know what we should do?

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:15.715
Do you want to do, like,
"Lady and the Tramp"-style?

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:17.383
-No.
-Okay.

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.219
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:22.621
Now, I know you got fired
from Red Lobster,

00:05:22.621 --> 00:05:25.624
and I think right now it's time
for a little redemption,

00:05:25.624 --> 00:05:27.860
a little Red Lobster redemption.
-Okay.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.263
-Upstairs, there's people
waiting for food.

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:32.231
They have no idea
that we're here.

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:35.067
Let's go serve some food
to these great people here.

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:36.636
-Oh, my God. Are you serious?

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:38.804
-Let's get the uniforms.
-Yes.

00:05:38.804 --> 00:05:42.275
♪♪

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:44.209
-Oh, my God.

00:05:44.209 --> 00:05:45.844
-Is everybody enjoying
their food?

00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:46.846
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:48.614
-This reminds me of when
I was in college

00:05:48.614 --> 00:05:50.783
'cause I had muscles
and I also had crabs once.

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:51.650
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.885
-Oh, my God.
-Uh, here we go.

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.487
Hi, guys!
-My name is Nicki.

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:56.889
I'm your server for the day.
Nice to meet you.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:58.858
-Nice to meet you.
Nice to meet you.

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:00.660
-We're from Trinidad.
-Trinidad!

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.329
[ All cheering ]

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:05.431
-Trinidad!
-My country!

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:07.800
My country is in the building!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.337
-I brought you a special drink.
It's a little rum and Coke.

00:06:11.337 --> 00:06:14.473
Let me take a taste test
just for a second.

00:06:14.473 --> 00:06:16.876
-Whoa. What now?
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:19.345
-Oh, my God.
I'm so sorry, you guys.

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:21.380
-Can we get one more
rum and Coke, please?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.015
Thank you very much.

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:25.918
-Oh, my God.
Don't eat people's biscuits!

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:28.187
What is wrong with --
I'm so sorry, you guys.

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:32.257
-That's okay. It's okay.
-All yours. All yours.

00:06:32.257 --> 00:06:33.692
-So, can I get you guys
anything?

00:06:33.692 --> 00:06:35.761
-Are you eating your biscuit
with a fork and knife?

00:06:35.761 --> 00:06:37.530
-Yeah, I don't want my hands
to get dirty.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.032
-Get -- Get out of Red Lobster.
-Oh, my God. You cannot do this.

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:41.667
This is too classy
for Red Lobster.

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:42.768
-Get out of Red Lobster.

00:06:42.768 --> 00:06:44.369
All right, Nicki,
you've proven yourself.

00:06:44.369 --> 00:06:45.604
You redeemed yourself.

00:06:45.604 --> 00:06:47.473
We've talked to everyone here
at Red Lobster,

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:49.175
and we have something
special for you --

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:51.210
The first and only black card.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:54.246
You get free
Cheddar Bay Biscuits for life.

00:06:54.246 --> 00:06:56.915
-Oh, my God. This is the nicest
thing anyone's ever given me.

00:06:56.915 --> 00:06:58.917
-No, no, no.
-Thank you.

00:06:58.917 --> 00:07:02.488
-I also tracked the people down

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:04.790
and I got your pen back.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.191
Redemption.
-You're amazing.

00:07:06.191 --> 00:07:07.727
-You've been redeemed.
I love you.

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:09.461
-I love you. Mwah!
Thank you so much!

00:07:09.461 --> 00:07:11.864
[ Laughs ]
-Oh, so much!

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:13.532
She's getting choked up!
Oh, my God!

00:07:13.532 --> 00:07:15.268
Oh, let's get
the basket of biscuits.

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:18.537
Oh, it's a basket of biscuits.
-What are you guys, insane?

00:07:18.537 --> 00:07:20.405
What the hell is this, y'all?
-We love you, Red Lobster.

00:07:20.405 --> 00:07:22.241
Let's get in the limo. Let's go.
-Oh, my God.

00:07:22.241 --> 00:07:23.909
-Let's go. We gotta go.
We gotta go.

00:07:23.909 --> 00:07:27.213
[ Cheers and applause ]

